            <ArticleTitle>[Dyes with properties of modulators of redox processes as potential immunotropic agents].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>563-72</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We performed an analysis of the biological activity of dyes possessing certain redox potential. This provided a theoretical basis for the development of a new trend in pharmacology. We demonstrate the wide potential associated with the use of this group of substances to regulate various biochemical processes in the immunity system.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
